error[E0277]: `/` on `CircuitVar` multiplies by a field inverse, which is not integer division
 --> tests/ui/fail/opaque_var.rs:4:33
  |
4 |     let quotient = left.clone() / right;
  |                                 ^ use `Uint::div_rem` for integer division
  |
  = help: the trait `circuit::builtins::field::var::rules::UseDivRem` is not implemented for `&CircuitVar`
  = note: turn the value into a `Uint<BITS>` with `Uint::try_from` first
  = note: for deliberate field division, use `CircuitVar::div`
  = note: required for `CircuitVar` to implement `Div<&CircuitVar>`

error[E0277]: `%` on `CircuitVar` has no meaning in the field
 --> tests/ui/fail/opaque_var.rs:5:31
  |
5 |     let remainder = &quotient % Field::from(2u64);
  |                               ^ use the remainder that `Uint::div_rem` returns
  |
  = help: the trait `circuit::builtins::field::var::rules::UseRemOfDivRem` is not implemented for `zolana_program::circuit::Field`
  = note: turn the value into a `Uint<BITS>` with `Uint::try_from` first
  = note: required for `&CircuitVar` to implement `Rem<zolana_program::circuit::Field>`

